Description: ASCOM Alpaca server for astronomy devices
 alpacahurd serves a herd of ASCOM Alpaca device drivers over HTTP and answers
 Alpaca UDP discovery for all of them. Each device is configured by one JSON
 file, and an orchestrator page at http://host:32227/setup shows the herd,
 edits each configuration and restarts individual devices.
 .
 This package installs the orchestrator and the simulated devices, which serve
 a complete no-hardware herd for verifying an install and developing clients.
 Drivers for real mounts, cameras, focusers, filter wheels and observing
 conditions ship as separate packages and install beside this one.

